[{"client_msg_id":"0a4af4f2-0c44-4483-b5a3-c722ff8ac21f","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"そうですねw","ts":"1620011825.089400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Xpw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"77C6133C-1C62-406A-8CDD-287E16A39579","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"失敗しない変換でエラー吐く意味ないのでw","ts":"1620010378.089100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"P=6H"}]},{"client_msg_id":"78294338-EE74-4FCD-B2E9-8B5C81F28BD0","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"正確には「失敗するかもしれない変換ができる」ですかね","ts":"1620010289.088600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9kd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0e49a6c2-ef5b-4ef2-a3d5-8060d3853e7b","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"か","ts":"1620010243.087600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XH8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"db623e19-9c5a-44a6-8363-22ad57c4e6d7","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"try_intoがあると、明示的に変換していて、かつエラーも吐けますっていうこと","ts":"1620010241.087400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jxfyf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"AAEAB6D2-ABE7-4B25-A561-63F2459D55C6","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"で暗黙変換がどちらかというと自動","ts":"1620010214.086800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2Px"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f4d69b4b-74b0-4450-8347-11672d68fbb4","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"なるほど","ts":"1620010204.086300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WFKH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"935E5B54-3D0C-4F12-A79D-85C95725D191","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"はい、暗黙変換と明示変換って関係ですね","ts":"1620010197.086100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PuZxg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f0e49db4-d6fe-4cef-9a75-ee7a9353dfe9","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"明示的？","ts":"1620010193.085800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qLL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"24F6E5CE-338B-4581-858E-296FE58208DB","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"ちな、このへんの「なんかやれば変換できる」は自動とはあまりいいません","ts":"1620010174.085100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"X4w"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3557987f-ce78-4558-8bb1-b02b7d167551","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"なるほど","ts":"1620010172.085000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PS+5N"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0fa8ec14-1d7f-4b1e-b876-5035f46310cd","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"intoだと、エラーを吐けないけど、try_intoだとエラーを吐かせることができる","ts":"1620010168.084700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qrYO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"A85AB1B9-5C0F-4B24-9361-305268A3C02C","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"です","ts":"1620010126.083200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+v1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3f4fa971-2f2d-4081-98ed-6e877fd2b2f6","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"ということは、try_intoは、Resultで返ってくるということですか？","ts":"1620010120.083000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nIA9C"}]},{"client_msg_id":"326b63bf-1c85-4609-860f-eaa2fdf2791e","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"ほんどだ間違えてました","ts":"1620010071.081500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PMR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"EF162B5F-EA57-4113-82A0-39F155745627","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"try_intoを呼ぶ事で明示的に変換できます。try_intoは失敗します","ts":"1620010055.081200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XIg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"CB11F4E5-3666-4F97-8C1E-E0D3CE671818","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"intoを呼ぶ事で明示的に変換できます。intoは失敗しません。","ts":"1620010032.080200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LE3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"84F3B8C7-544B-42E5-A4B7-8AF9FC90D0CB","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"try_intoは別物です","ts":"1620009986.079500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+cU8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"193D2E4A-BDD1-4762-B3E9-0D250BA83DE9","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"これはintoですね","ts":"1620009975.079100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gQHR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9ee38269-4080-4cfa-bf33-4bd17a2d0c53","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"try_intoの挙動があまり理解できてない。\n変数の型(この場合boolが、u32)に自動的に変換してくれる認識でいいのかな","ts":"1620009681.078800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4NTR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b953a320-86ed-4aa9-a895-1ebb338275ee","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"\u003chttps://play.rust-lang.org/?edition=2018\u0026amp;code=fn%20main()%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20let%20n%3A%20u32%20%3D%20true.into()%3B%0A%20%20%20%20println!(%22%7B%7D%22%2C%20n)%3B%0A%7D%0A\u003e","ts":"1620009572.076500","attachments":[{"fallback":"Rust Playground","id":1,"title":"Rust Playground","title_link":"https://play.rust-lang.org/?edition=2018\u0026code=fn%20main()%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20let%20n%3A%20u32%20%3D%20true.into()%3B%0A%20%20%20%20println!(%22%7B%7D%22%2C%20n)%3B%0A%7D%0A","text":"A browser interface to the Rust compil